From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:19:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 41/44] Move the VM lifecycle message bodies to a Vm_message
 module
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Each VM lifecycle message (VM_STARTED, VM_MIGRATED, VM_SNAPSHOTTED...)
created in Message_forwarding had its body built inline. Move the
code building each body, unchanged, to a separate function of a new
Vm_message module, so that it can be tested.

The moved lines can be checked with:

  git show --color-moved=plain --color-moved-ws=allow-indentation-change

Apart from the new function headers and their calls, the only lines
that are not moved as is are those of the VM_MIGRATED format string:
since it is less indented in Vm_message, ocamlformat splits it at a
different place.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
---
