 ocaml/xapi/vm_message.ml         | 130 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ocaml/xapi/vm_message.mli        |  70 +++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 218 insertions(+), 109 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ocaml/xapi/vm_message.ml
